{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048170/extras/679fb86bcf99fb05addf86d5387f1543.poster.avif?t=1774789415\" width=1024 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048170/extras/679fb86bcf99fb05addf86d5387f1543.webm?t=1774789415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048170/extras/679fb86bcf99fb05addf86d5387f1543.mp4?t=1774789415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snow seals you inside a luxurious men\u2019s spa. A guest is found dead.  Your memory is fractured. Among the group of alluring men, one may be the killer.\u00a0Suspicion grows, desire blurs with danger, and a tarot reading whispers of fate: <i>The Devil. Death. The Lovers.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048170/extras/3433c771400bb89ab17eded3df92ef39.poster.avif?t=1774789415\" width=1024 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048170/extras/3433c771400bb89ab17eded3df92ef39.webm?t=1774789415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048170/extras/3433c771400bb89ab17eded3df92ef39.mp4?t=1774789415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Lucas, you\u2019ll collect evidence, solve puzzles, and unravel the mysteries of Marble House. With six romance options, every bond you form could lead to passion - or peril.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048170/extras/07448eeb142a44ba988735f1667b7a10.poster.avif?t=1774789415\" width=1024 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048170/extras/07448eeb142a44ba988735f1667b7a10.webm?t=1774789415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048170/extras/07448eeb142a44ba988735f1667b7a10.mp4?t=1774789415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Erotic thriller mystery</strong>\u00a0- a snowbound luxury spa becomes a stage for murder, secrets, and desire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices that matter</strong>\u00a0- Lucas\u2019s Charm, Guile, and Sense shape dialogue and relationships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigative gameplay</strong>\u00a0<strong>-</strong> explore environments, collect clues, and expose the killer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Glass puzzles</strong>\u00a0<strong>-</strong> reassemble fractured memory shards as Lucas uncovers the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six romanceable characters</strong>\u00a0- pursue relationships and unlock explicit scenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Partially voiced\u00a0-</strong>\u00a0characters react with voiced emotes for added immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong>\u00a0<strong>-</strong> find love, solve the mystery, or fail entirely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gallery - </strong>unlock CGs and Tarot cards as the story unfolds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Note from the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a solo developer, this game has been a labor of love for several years. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am excited for players to enjoy the game for its narrative, atmosphere, and relationships.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048170?t=1774789415","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048170/409b26dd97f08056fda6d14477ba75eb6f9f93cb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774789415","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048170/f9fd754448e4bae01e593321e8f77a1e04bf1566/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774789415","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048170/f9fd754448e4bae01e593321e8f77a1e04bf1566/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774789415","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"This game contains explicit sexual content, including graphic depictions and descriptive text. The game includes occasional strong language and depicts a corpse."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048170/extras/679fb86bcf99fb05addf86d5387f1543.poster.avif?t=1774789415\" width=1024 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048170/extras/679fb86bcf99fb05addf86d5387f1543.webm?t=1774789415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\